#. i18n: file: tips:28
#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#: tips.cpp:26
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can associate mailing lists with folders in the\n"
"<em>Folder-&gt;Mailing List Management</em> dialog? You can then use\n"
"<em>Message-&gt;New Message to Mailing List...</em>\n"
